# gunship.px (v2) - carrier gunship (Area 1, CIRRUS LINE), aggressive alien machinery pass
# canvas 40x32, 2 frames (maw/engine glow flicker, loop). Faces DOWN.
# faceted hex carapace of ribbed armour plates (rib seams at rows 8 and 12) with a raised dorsal spine;
# two blade horns raking back from the rear corners; two scythe blades swinging out from the flanks and
# raking forward; two heavy hooked mandibles at the front. Between each mandible and the central ram jaw a
# launch maw opens forward, lit from inside by fire glow: the dart pairs come out of the maws.
# Red: three-eye sensor cluster (two 2x2 eyes high on the face, one 2x2 eye low on the centreline).
# light: top-left (left half lit, right half one ramp step darker; plate tops lit below each rib seam).
# smallest must-read feature: the red eyes (2x2 each); second: the two maw glows (2x1 each).
# anchor: frame centre (20,16).
# timing: 100 ms each (6 ticks). Only the 4 engine and 4 maw glow pixels change (O <-> Q).
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
2 #2f3a5a  steel-1
3 #4a5a82  steel-2
4 #7184ad  steel-3
a #1b2622  olive-0
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
n #92203a  red-1
r #da3d4f  red-2
O #ec7424  fire-2
Q #ffb347  fire-3
ramp steel 2 3 4
ramp olive a b c d e
ramp red n r
ramp fire O Q
frame a 100
